Ad Studio angle example thumbnails go here.

The Step 3 "Pick the ad angle" cards show a visual example of what
each angle produces. Until these files exist the cards render a
clean branded gradient + label (graceful fallback — nothing looks
broken). Drop the 6 files here to light them up:

  lifestyle_hold.jpg
  problem_solution.jpg
  testimonial.jpg
  unboxing.jpg
  before_after.jpg
  demo.jpg

Specs:
  - 9:16 vertical, ~720x1280 (cards are small; keep files < 200 KB)
  - Should look like a real UGC ad shot for THAT angle, with a
    generic-ish product (so it reads as "this is the style," not
    "this is one specific brand")
  - Best path: dogfood it — open /tools/ad-studio, pick any trained
    creator + a clean generic product (a plain serum bottle works
    great), run each of the 6 angles once, download the result,
    rename to {key}.jpg, drop it here. On-brand examples + a "we
    use our own product" story for free.
